  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "dc33af70-53b6-44b0-95c9-7720ea5c6db6",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1008,
        -16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 704,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## Social Media Content + Image Generator (Claude/Gemini/OpenAI)\n\n### How it works\n\nThe workflow contains no nodes, so there is no executable automation to analyze. No triggers, processing steps, or outputs are currently defined on the canvas.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Add at least one trigger node to start the workflow.\n- Add processing and output nodes as needed, then configure any required credentials.\n\n### Customization\n\nOnce nodes are added, they can be grouped by their canvas position and role in the automation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a0cc85c9-b380-418e-9f9e-2c0302e7e814",
      "name": "Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -256,
        -16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 756,
        "content": "## 1. Receive, settings, validate & route\n\ud83d\udd18 **Settings** node = master switches. Toggle `image_generation_enabled` ON/OFF (OFF = text only, image skipped for every request).\n`provider`: `claude` (default), `gemini` or `openai`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "83d10128-f9b3-4ff4-bab6-9ed8223dd4be",
      "name": "Generate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        864,
        -16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 736,
        "height": 1360,
        "content": "## 2. Generate\n\u26a0\ufe0f Set credentials on the chat model nodes: **Anthropic** (top), **Google Gemini** (middle), **OpenAI** (bottom). Only the ones you use are required."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "be6d7f0d-bcc8-488a-97ce-dfee8bcd2a8e",
