      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Merge generated text with the image result (OpenAI or Gemini)\nconst text = $('Image Requested?').first().json.output;\nconst cfg = $('Validate Input').first().json;\nconst res = $input.first().json;\nlet b64 = null, mime = 'image/jpeg';\nif (res.data?.[0]?.b64_json) {                       // OpenAI\n  b64 = res.data[0].b64_json;\n} else {                                             // Gemini\n  const part = (res.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts || []).find(p => p.inlineData || p.inline_data);\n  const d = part?.inlineData || part?.inline_data;\n  if (d?.data) { b64 = d.data; mime = d.mimeType || d.mime_type || 'image/png'; }\n}\nconst image = b64\n  ? { provider: cfg.image_provider, mime_type: mime, size: cfg.image_size, prompt_idea: text?.instagram?.image_idea, data_uri: `data:${mime};base64,${b64}` }\n  : { provider: cfg.image_provider, error: [res.error?.message, res.error?.description].filter(Boolean).join(' | ') || res.error || res.candidates?.[0]?.finishReason || 'Image generation failed' };\nreturn [{ json: { output: text, image } }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "9d64df5b-da96-4327-9bfb-0aade5bda661",
      "name": "Image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1632,
        -16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 896,
        "height": 824,
        "content": "## 3. Generate image (optional)\nUses the Instagram `image_idea` + `image_style`. `image_provider`: **openai** (gpt-image-1) or **gemini** (gemini-2.5-flash-image). Defaults to the text provider (Claude \u2192 Gemini). Returned as a base64 `data_uri`. Skipped when `generate_image` is `false`; on failure text is still returned with `image.error`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
